---
import ArticleLayout from "../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
---

<ArticleLayout
  title="Contact GarageCloud"
  description="Get in touch with GarageCloud about the waiting list, pricing or partnering with us."
  eyebrow="Contact"
  breadcrumbLabel="Contact"
  heading="Get in touch"
  lede="GarageCloud is pre-launch, so the fastest way to reach us is email."
>
  <p>
    For questions about the waiting list, pricing, or anything else, email
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> and we will get back to you.
  </p>

  <h2>Press and partnerships</h2>
  <p>
    Trade press, directories and potential integration partners can use the same address. Include a line on who you
    are and what you are asking about, and it will get to the right place.
  </p>

  <h2>Already on the waiting list?</h2>
  <p>
    We will only email you about the GarageCloud launch. If you want to update your details or be removed from the
    list, email us and we will sort it.
  </p>
</ArticleLayout>
